{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/notificationcenter\/mainactormessage"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Protocol","symbolKind":"protocol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MainActorMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials18NotificationCenterC16MainActorMessageP","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MainActorMessage"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false}],"extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","title":"NotificationCenter.MainActorMessage"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Declaring subject type","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/MainActorMessage\/Subject"],"anchor":"Declaring-subject-type"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Declaring a notification message","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/AsyncMessage"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Declaring-a-notification-message"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A protocol for creating types that you can post to a notification center and bind to the main actor.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/MainActorMessage","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MainActorMessage","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s16SendableMetatypeP","text":"SendableMetatype","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You post types conforming to  "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MainActorMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" to a notification center using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"post(_:subject:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and observe them with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"addObserver(of:for:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":". The notification center delivers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MainActorMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" types synchronously when posted."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For types that post on an arbitrary isolation, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/AsyncMessage","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MainActorMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" is associated with a specific "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Subject"},{"type":"text","text":" type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"MainActorMessage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" associated with the type ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" could use the following declaration:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct EventDidStart: NotificationCenter.MainActorMessage {","    typealias Subject = Event","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MainActorMessage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can use an optional ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/MessageIdentifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" type for context-aware observer registration:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["extension NotificationCenter.MessageIdentifier where Self == NotificationCenter.BaseMessageIdentifier<EventDidStart> {","    static var didStart: Self { .init() }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With this identifier, observers can receive information about a specific instance by registering for this message with a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let observerToken = NotificationCenter.default.addObserver(of: importantEvent, for: .didStart)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or an observer can receive information about any instance with:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let observerToken = NotificationCenter.default.addObserver(of: Event.self, for: .didStart)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The notification center ties observation the lifetime of the returned "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/ObservationToken"},{"type":"text","text":" and automatically de-registers the observer if the token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"goes out of scope. You can also remove observation explicitly:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["NotificationCenter.default.removeObserver(observerToken)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Notification-Interoperability","level":3,"text":"Notification Interoperability"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MainActorMessage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" includes optional interoperability with ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", enabling posters and observers of both types","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to pass information.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It does this by offering a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeMessage(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method that collects values from a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification\/userInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" and populates properties on a new message."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In the other direction, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeNotification(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method collects the message’s defined properties and loads them into a new notification’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification\/userInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" dictionary."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, if there exists a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" posted on ","type":"text"},{"code":"MainActor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identified by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification\/Name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"eventDidFinish\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification\/userInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dictionary containing the key ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"duration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", an app could post and observe the notification with the following ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/NotificationCenter\/MainActorMessage","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct EventDidFinish: NotificationCenter.MainActorMessage {","    typealias Subject = Event","    static var name: Notification.Name { Notification.Name(\"eventDidFinish\") }","","    var duration: Int","","    static func makeNotification(_ message: Self) -> Notification {","        return Notification(name: Self.name, userInfo: [\"duration\": NSNumber(message.duration)])","    }","","    static func makeMessage(_ notification: Notification) -> Self? {","        guard let userInfo = notification.userInfo,","              let duration = userInfo[\"duration\"] as? Int","        else {","            return nil","        }","","        return Self(duration: duration)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With this definition, an observer for this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MainActorMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" type receives information even if the poster used the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification"},{"type":"text","text":" equivalent, and vice versa."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/NotificationCenter/MainActorMessage/Subject":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Subject"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","required":true,"title":"Subject","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type which you can optionally post and observe along with this "},{"code":"MainActorMessage",